d the bug's DoD (AC1: `terraform plan` completes).\n\nDEFERRED DEPLOYMENT DECISION (out of the original bug's envelope):\nThe pending `terraform plan` recorded on rubied reports `Plan: 6 to add, 1 to change, 0 to destroy`:\n- 2 new CloudWatch alarms: `mcp_mem_abort` and `mcp_retire_cap`\n- in-place update of `aws_instance.gerrit` user_data\n- 4 new `rebar_secrets` SSM params for MCP client PATs\nThe three `import` blocks in the plan are already adopted as no-op.\n\nRunning `terraform apply` against prod touches infrastructure beyond the dd30 bug's blast radius and is an OPERATOR DECISION requiring explicit human approval. This ticket tracks that go/no-go apply decision; it must NOT be executed autonomously by an agent.\n\nAcceptance criteria:\n- An operator explicitly reviews the recorded plan (6 add / 1 change / 0 destroy) and approves or rejects the `terraform apply`.\n- If approved, the apply is performed by/with a human operator and the resulting state is recorded back on this ticket.","env_id":"eea68b7f-6697-488b-ac52-744e2ed8e96f","file_impact":[],"file_impact_scope":"undeclared","keyring":[],"managed_refs":[],"no_file_impact_reason":"","parent_id":null,"parent_status_uuid":"","plan_review_phase":"planning","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":2,"repos":[],"reverts":[],"status":"open","tags":[],"ticket_id":"f268-32ae-4ea9-42fb","ticket_type":"task","title":"Operator decision: apply the terraform plan for user_data + MCP SSM params (blast radius exceeds dd30 envelope)","verify_commands":[]},"source_event_uuids":["8e0bf7e6-03cd-4d0a-a36f-0acbf10a5caa","cc046b66-e1a3-434d-a80e-2f09ced43381"]},"env_id":"eea68b7f-6697-488b-ac52-744e2ed8e96f","event_type":"SNAPSHOT","timestamp":1788024977465541034,"uuid":"9ffd5c06-b8b9-413c-91bf-b9ad89960ae4"}